BHRAM is a university research project implementing a controlled honeypot
laboratory environment for academic study of cyber-deception techniques.

This software is intended ONLY for:
  - Academic research in controlled, isolated laboratory environments.
  - University coursework and study.
  - Authorized cybersecurity research with proper ethics approval.

This software MUST NOT be used:
  - Against systems you do not own or have explicit written authorization to test.
  - In production environments without thorough security review.
  - In any manner that violates applicable law or institutional policy.

All company names, employee names, credentials, and documents within the
deception environment are ENTIRELY FICTIONAL.
